  "body": "### Summary\nAs the AQ write flow's author, I want the answer to adding a post to an existing AQ once the flood limit is reached, so that the app does not treat it as a success.\n\n### Scope\nCapture from a **local** instance of `toyo@96c0aea` only, never the live service (same method as #574): after three recent creations, send an addition (`alerte_qualitay_id` set) and record the status and body.\n\n### Sources\n`aq/api/addAlerte.php:69` runs the flood check before the creation/addition branch at `:95`. `docs/HFR-PROTOCOL.md`, Anti-flood bullet of LOT-055, marks it *pending capture*.\n\n### Acceptance criteria\nAnonymized fixture committed, manifest and protocol entry updated, the *pending capture* mark removed.\n",
